<body>
<x-dc>
<helmet data-dc-atomics><meta name="design_doc_mode" content="canvas"><style>body{margin:0;background:#e9e6e0}a{color:#2563eb}a:hover{color:#1b4fc4}</style></helmet>

<div style="padding:44px 48px 28px;font:14px/1.55 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1c1b19;max-width:1000px">
<div style="font:600 11px/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#8a8680;text-transform:uppercase">Ahoy · web UI · design proposal</div>
<h1 style="font:600 30px/1.2 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;margin:12px 0 14px;letter-spacing:-.015em">Two decisions, made hard to make carelessly</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;max-width:76ch;color:#3f3d39;text-wrap:pretty">Everything here evolves the existing language rather than replacing it: same 250px sidebar and fluid detail column, same tokens, same prose-first voice. No animation carries meaning, no state lives only in the browser, and no control moves a story that the harness hasn't already been asked to move.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 20px;max-width:76ch;color:#3f3d39;text-wrap:pretty">Margin notes sit to the right of every artboard. Anything marked <span style="display:inline-block;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#fbf1dd;color:#8a5a00;font:600 10.5px/1.5 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.06em">BEHAVIOUR CHANGE</span> is a proposal about what the product does, not how it looks — weigh those against the harness before the pixels.</p>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px 10px;font:12px/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace">
<a href="#2a" style="padding:6px 10px;background:#f4f7fe;border:1px solid #c9d8f7;border-radius:7px;text-decoration:none">2a sidebar at scale</a>
<a href="#a1" style="padding:6px 10px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8e5e0;border-radius:7px;text-decoration:none">01 story list</a>
<a href="#a2" style="padding:6px 10px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8e5e0;border-radius:7px;text-decoration:none">02 new story</a>
<a href="#a3" style="padding:6px 10px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8e5e0;border-radius:7px;text-decoration:none">03 running</a>
<a href="#a4" style="padding:6px 10px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8e5e0;border-radius:7px;text-decoration:none">04 waiting</a>
<a href="#a5" style="padding:6px 10px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8e5e0;border-radius:7px;text-decoration:none">05 plan gate</a>
<a href="#a6" style="padding:6px 10px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8e5e0;border-radius:7px;text-decoration:none">06 send back</a>
<a href="#a7" style="padding:6px 10px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8e5e0;border-radius:7px;text-decoration:none">07 reviewers agree</a>
<a href="#a8" style="padding:6px 10px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8e5e0;border-radius:7px;text-decoration:none">08 reviewers split</a>
<a href="#a9" style="padding:6px 10px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8e5e0;border-radius:7px;text-decoration:none">09 delivery</a>
<a href="#a10" style="padding:6px 10px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8e5e0;border-radius:7px;text-decoration:none">10 stalled · blocked · refusal</a>
<a href="#a11" style="padding:6px 10px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8e5e0;border-radius:7px;text-decoration:none">11 components</a>
</div>
</div>

<div id="2a" style="padding:24px 48px 12px;display:flex;gap:34px;align-items:flex-start;scroll-margin-top:16px">
<div style="flex:none;width:1180px">
<div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin:0 0 4px;font:600 11px/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#8a8680"><span style="padding:3px 7px;background:#2563eb;color:#fff;border-radius:4px">2a</span><span style="font-size:13px;letter-spacing:0;color:#1c1b19">The sidebar when specs/ has grown</span></div>
<p style="margin:0 0 14px;max-width:88ch;font:13px/1.55 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#3f3d39;text-wrap:pretty">The list is every directory in <span style="font:12px/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace">specs/</span> that has a <span style="font:12px/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace">state.json</span>, and nothing ever deletes one. Same three groups at 6, 43 and 210 stories — what changes is what is allowed to take space.</p>

<div style="display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:flex-start;font:14px/1.5 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1c1b19">

