<div style="padding:12px 12px 4px;font:600 10px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#8a5a00;border-top:1px solid #e8e5e0">STOPPED MOVING · 1 of 12 match</div>
