<div style="padding:10px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e8e5e0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between"><span style="font:600 10px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#8a8680">FINISHED · 12 of 183</span><a href="#2a" style="font-size:11.5px;color:#2563eb;text-decoration:none">Show</a></div>
<div style="padding:9px 12px 11px;border-top:1px solid #e8e5e0;background:#faf9f7"><a href="#2a" style="font-size:11.5px;color:#2563eb;text-decoration:none">All 210 stories, as a table ↗</a></div>
