<div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;padding:14px 16px;border:1px solid #e8e5e0;background:#fff;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:14px">
<span style="width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:#157f4a;flex:none;margin-top:5px"></span>
<div style="flex:1">
<div style="font:600 14px/1.35 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif">Nothing is being asked of you. This is running.</div>
<div style="font-size:13px;color:#3f3d39;margin-top:3px;max-width:88ch;text-wrap:pretty">Both reviewers say the same three criteria are not met, so there is nothing to settle. The router has sent the story to <span style="font:12px/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace">rework</span> on its own and a fixer is already on AC3. You will be called back at the delivery gate.</div>
</div>
<div style="flex:none;text-align:right;font:11.5px/1.5 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;color:#6b6862">rework round 1<br /><span style="color:#a5a099">started 14:07</span></div>
</div>

<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8e5e0;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden">
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:52px 1fr 208px 208px 156px;align-items:center;padding:11px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid #e8e5e0;font:600 10px/1.3 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.08em;color:#a5a099">
<div></div><div>CRITERION</div>
<div style="color:#3f3d39">LOOKOUT A · design and fit<div style="font:400 10px/1.4 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;color:#a5a099;letter-spacing:0;text-transform:none">sonnet · reads for intent</div></div>
<div style="color:#3f3d39">LOOKOUT B · failure and edges<div style="font:400 10px/1.4 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;color:#a5a099;letter-spacing:0;text-transform:none">opus · reads for what breaks</div></div>
<div>WHAT HAPPENS</div>
</div>

<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:52px 1fr 208px 208px 156px;align-items:center;padding:12px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0eeea;font-size:13px">
<div style="font:600 11.5px/1.6 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;color:#8a8680">AC1</div>
<div style="padding-right:20px;color:#3f3d39">Column order persists for the signed-in user</div>
<div><span style="padding:3px 9px;border-radius:20px;background:#e8f4ec;color:#157f4a;font:500 11.5px/1.4 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif">met</span></div>
<div><span style="padding:3px 9px;border-radius:20px;background:#e8f4ec;color:#157f4a;font:500 11.5px/1.4 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif">met</span></div>
<div style="font-size:12.5px;color:#8a8680">nothing</div>
</div>

<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:52px 1fr 208px 208px 156px;align-items:center;padding:12px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0eeea;font-size:13px">
<div style="font:600 11.5px/1.6 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;color:#8a8680">AC2</div>
<div style="padding-right:20px;color:#3f3d39">Order survives a logout and a new session</div>
<div><span style="padding:3px 9px;border-radius:20px;background:#e8f4ec;color:#157f4a;font:500 11.5px/1.4 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif">met</span></div>
<div><span style="padding:3px 9px;border-radius:20px;background:#e8f4ec;color:#157f4a;font:500 11.5px/1.4 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif">met</span></div>
<div style="font-size:12.5px;color:#8a8680">nothing</div>
</div>

<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:52px 1fr 208px 208px 156px;align-items:start;padding:13px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0eeea;font-size:13px;background:#fdf6f5;border-left:3px solid #b4261a;margin-left:-0px">
<div style="font:600 11.5px/1.6 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;color:#b4261a">AC3</div>
<div style="padding-right:20px;color:#1c1b19">
<div>Re-ordering is available from the keyboard, not only by drag</div>
<div style="margin-top:6px;font-size:12.5px;color:#6b6862;line-height:1.5;text-wrap:pretty">Both reviewers point at <span style="font:11.5px/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace">ColumnHeader.tsx:212</span> — the handler is bound to pointer events only.</div>
</div>
<div><span style="padding:3px 9px;border-radius:20px;background:#fbe9e7;color:#b4261a;font:500 11.5px/1.4 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif">not met</span></div>
<div><span style="padding:3px 9px;border-radius:20px;background:#fbe9e7;color:#b4261a;font:500 11.5px/1.4 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif">not met</span></div>
<div style="font-size:12.5px;color:#b4261a;font-weight:500">sent to rework<div style="font:400 11.5px/1.5 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;color:#8a8680">WP1 · in progress</div></div>
</div>

<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:52px 1fr 208px 208px 156px;align-items:start;padding:13px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0eeea;font-size:13px;background:#fdf6f5;border-left:3px solid #b4261a">
<div style="font:600 11.5px/1.6 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;color:#b4261a">AC5</div>
<div style="padding-right:20px;color:#1c1b19">Reordering fires one save, not one per column moved</div>
<div><span style="padding:3px 9px;border-radius:20px;background:#fbe9e7;color:#b4261a;font:500 11.5px/1.4 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif">not met</span></div>
<div><span style="padding:3px 9px;border-radius:20px;background:#fbe9e7;color:#b4261a;font:500 11.5px/1.4 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif">not met</span></div>
<div style="font-size:12.5px;color:#b4261a;font-weight:500">sent to rework<div style="font:400 11.5px/1.5 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;color:#8a8680">WP1 · queued</div></div>
</div>

<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:52px 1fr 208px 208px 156px;align-items:start;padding:13px 18px;font-size:13px;background:#fdf6f5;border-left:3px solid #b4261a">
<div style="font:600 11.5px/1.6 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;color:#b4261a">AC6</div>
<div style="padding-right:20px;color:#1c1b19">No test covers the ordering round-trip</div>
<div><span style="padding:3px 9px;border-radius:20px;background:#fbe9e7;color:#b4261a;font:500 11.5px/1.4 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif">not met</span></div>
<div><span style="padding:3px 9px;border-radius:20px;background:#fbe9e7;color:#b4261a;font:500 11.5px/1.4 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif">not met</span></div>
<div style="font-size:12.5px;color:#b4261a;font-weight:500">sent to rework<div style="font:400 11.5px/1.5 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;color:#8a8680">WP2 · queued</div></div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="margin-top:10px;font-size:12.5px;color:#6b6862">The full findings from each reviewer sit below this table, unabridged. Nothing here needs a button — there is no decision to make while the reviewers agree.</div>
</div>
</div>
<sc-if value="{{ showNotes }}" hint-placeholder-val="{{ true }}">
<div style="flex:none;width:320px;position:sticky;top:16px;font:13px/1.55 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#3f3d39">
<div style="border-left:2px solid #cfcbc4;padding:2px 0 2px 16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px">
<div><div style="font:600 10px/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#8a8680;margin-bottom:6px">ONE ROW PER CRITERION</div><p style="margin:0;text-wrap:pretty">The criterion is the unit of agreement, so it is the unit of layout. Two reviewer columns side by side means a split is a <b>horizontal mismatch you can see without reading</b> — that is what makes artboard <a href="#a8">08</a> work, and it only works because this table is the same table.</p></div>
<div><p style="margin:0;text-wrap:pretty">The fifth column, <b>"what happens"</b>, is the point of the screen. Verdicts are inputs; the consequence is what the person came for. Met rows say "nothing" rather than being left blank — a blank cell reads as missing data.</p></div>
<div><p style="margin:0;text-wrap:pretty">Reviewer identity carries its <b>model and its lens</b> in the header. Two verdicts only mean something if you know they were produced by different readings.</p></div>
<div><p style="margin:0;text-wrap:pretty">The banner opens with <b>"nothing is being asked of you"</b>. Three red rows look like a summons; they are not one. Saying so first is the difference between a person closing the tab and a person hunting for a button that does not exist.</p></div>
<div><p style="margin:0;text-wrap:pretty">Green is quiet: a pale chip and grey text. Red gets a fill, a left edge and a bold consequence. Attention goes to what is unmet without the met rows disappearing.</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</sc-if>
</div>

<div id="a8" style="padding:24px 48px 12px;display:flex;gap:34px;align-items:flex-start;scroll-margin-top:16px">
<div style="flex:none;width:1180px">
<div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin:0 0 12px;font:600 11px/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#8a8680"><span style="padding:3px 7px;background:#b4261a;color:#fff;border-radius:4px">08</span><span style="font-size:13px;letter-spacing:0;color:#1c1b19">PR review — the reviewers split. This is the summons.</span></div>
<div style="background:#faf9f7;border:1px solid #e8e5e0;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 20px 20px;font:14px/1.5 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1c1b19">
<div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:14px">
<div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:12px"><span style="font:600 20px/1.2 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:-.01em">R3DA-14001</span><span style="font-size:13.5px;color:#6b6862">Bulk export for saved views · frontend, exports</span></div>
<div style="display:flex;gap:14px;font-size:12.5px"><a href="#" style="text-decoration:none">PR #4131 ↗</a><a href="#" style="text-decoration:none">Jira ↗</a></div>
</div>

<div style="border:1px solid #b4261a;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:16px">
<div style="background:#b4261a;color:#fff;padding:15px 18px">
<div style="font:600 16px/1.3 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif">The two reviewers disagree about 2 of 7 criteria. The story has stopped here.</div>
<div style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:5px;opacity:.92;max-width:96ch;text-wrap:pretty">Ahoy will not send a fixer to change something one competent reviewer already calls correct — that is a loop with no way out. Nothing moves, in either direction, until you say which reading holds.</div>
</div>
<div style="background:#fdf6f5;padding:11px 18px;display:flex;gap:26px;font-size:12.5px;color:#3f3d39;border-top:1px solid #f2cdc8">
<span><b style="color:#b4261a">2</b> disputed — waiting on you</span>
<span><b style="color:#8a5a00">1</b> agreed unmet — will go to rework once the dispute is settled</span>
<span><b style="color:#157f4a">4</b> agreed met</span>
</div>
</div>

<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;margin-bottom:16px">

<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #f2cdc8;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden">
<div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;padding:13px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid #f2cdc8;background:#fdf6f5">
<span style="font:600 12px/1.4 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;color:#b4261a">AC4</span>
<span style="flex:1;font:600 14px/1.4 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif">An export larger than 10,000 rows is refused with a message, not truncated</span>
<span style="font:600 11px/1.4 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;color:#b4261a;letter-spacing:.06em">DISPUTED</span>
</div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1px 1fr">
<div style="padding:15px 18px">
<div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;margin-bottom:9px"><span style="padding:3px 9px;border-radius:20px;background:#e8f4ec;color:#157f4a;font:600 11.5px/1.4 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif">met</span><span style="font:600 12px/1.4 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#3f3d39">Lookout A</span><span style="font:11px/1.4 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;color:#a5a099">design and fit</span></div>
<p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:#3f3d39;text-wrap:pretty">The guard exists and returns a clear message. The ticket asks for a refusal with an explanation and that is what the user gets.</p>
<div style="font:11.5px/1.7 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;color:#6b6862;background:#faf9f7;border-radius:6px;padding:8px 10px">exports/src/limit.ts:44<br />frontend/src/ExportDialog.tsx:180</div>
</div>
<div style="background:#f2cdc8"></div>
<div style="padding:15px 18px">
<div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;margin-bottom:9px"><span style="padding:3px 9px;border-radius:20px;background:#fbe9e7;color:#b4261a;font:600 11.5px/1.4 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif">not met</span><span style="font:600 12px/1.4 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#3f3d39">Lookout B</span><span style="font:11px/1.4 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;color:#a5a099">failure and edges</span></div>
<p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:#3f3d39;text-wrap:pretty">The guard runs in the dialog, after the query has already streamed. A scheduled export skips the dialog entirely and truncates at 10,000 silently.</p>
<div style="font:11.5px/1.7 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;color:#6b6862;background:#faf9f7;border-radius:6px;padding:8px 10px">exports/src/scheduled.ts:96 — no limit check</div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="padding:12px 18px;border-top:1px solid #f2cdc8;background:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap">
<span style="font-size:12.5px;color:#6b6862">Which reading holds?</span>
<button style="padding:7px 13px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #d7dbe3;border-radius:20px;font:500 12.5px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#3f3d39;cursor:pointer" style-hover="border-color:#157f4a;color:#157f4a">A is right — this is met</button>
<button style="padding:7px 13px;background:#fbe9e7;border:1px solid #b4261a;border-radius:20px;font:600 12.5px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#b4261a;cursor:pointer">B is right — send to rework ✓</button>
<span style="font-size:12px;color:#8a8680;margin-left:2px">Adds a line to the reason below. Nothing is submitted yet.</span>
</div>
</div>

<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #f2cdc8;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden">
<div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;padding:13px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid #f2cdc8;background:#fdf6f5">
<span style="font:600 12px/1.4 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;color:#b4261a">AC6</span>
<span style="flex:1;font:600 14px/1.4 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif">The export keeps the column order the user configured</span>
<span style="font:600 11px/1.4 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;color:#b4261a;letter-spacing:.06em">DISPUTED</span>
</div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1px 1fr">
<div style="padding:15px 18px">
<div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;margin-bottom:9px"><span style="padding:3px 9px;border-radius:20px;background:#fbe9e7;color:#b4261a;font:600 11.5px/1.4 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif">not met</span><span style="font:600 12px/1.4 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#3f3d39">Lookout A</span><span style="font:11px/1.4 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;color:#a5a099">design and fit</span></div>
<p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:#3f3d39;text-wrap:pretty">The export uses the schema order. The criterion quotes the ticket asking for "the columns as I arranged them", which this does not honour.</p>
<div style="font:11.5px/1.7 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;color:#6b6862;background:#faf9f7;border-radius:6px;padding:8px 10px">exports/src/serialize.ts:31</div>
</div>
<div style="background:#f2cdc8"></div>
<div style="padding:15px 18px">
<div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;margin-bottom:9px"><span style="padding:3px 9px;border-radius:20px;background:#e8f4ec;color:#157f4a;font:600 11.5px/1.4 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif">met</span><span style="font:600 12px/1.4 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#3f3d39">Lookout B</span><span style="font:11px/1.4 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;color:#a5a099">failure and edges</span></div>
<p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:#3f3d39;text-wrap:pretty">Order is applied downstream in the CSV writer, so the file is correct. The serializer's order is never observable.</p>
<div style="font:11.5px/1.7 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;color:#6b6862;background:#faf9f7;border-radius:6px;padding:8px 10px">exports/src/csv.ts:78 · test exports/ordering.spec.ts</div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="padding:12px 18px;border-top:1px solid #f2cdc8;background:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap">
<span style="font-size:12.5px;color:#6b6862">Which reading holds?</span>
<button style="padding:7px 13px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #d7dbe3;border-radius:20px;font:500 12.5px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#3f3d39;cursor:pointer" style-hover="border-color:#b4261a;color:#b4261a">A is right — send to rework</button>
<button style="padding:7px 13px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #d7dbe3;border-radius:20px;font:500 12.5px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#3f3d39;cursor:pointer" style-hover="border-color:#157f4a;color:#157f4a">B is right — this is met</button>
<span style="font-size:12px;color:#8a8680;margin-left:2px">Not yet answered.</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<details style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8e5e0;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 18px;margin-bottom:16px"><summary style="font:500 13px/1.4 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#2563eb;cursor:pointer">The 5 criteria the reviewers agree on — 4 met, 1 unmet and bound for rework</summary></details>

<div style="background:#fff;border:2px solid #b4261a;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;max-width:860px">
<div style="font:600 15px/1.3 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;margin-bottom:4px">Settle the disagreement</div>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:13px;color:#3f3d39;max-width:72ch;text-wrap:pretty">One of the two criteria above is still unanswered. Your text is what the harness records and what a fixer reads — the buttons above only draft it.</p>
<textarea style="width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;height:92px;padding:11px 13px;border:1px solid #e8e5e0;border-radius:8px;font:13.5px/1.55 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1c1b19;resize:vertical;background:#faf9f7">AC4 — B is right. The scheduled path is the one that matters; move the guard out of the dialog.</textarea>
<div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:12px;flex-wrap:wrap">
<button style="padding:11px 18px;background:#f7f6f4;color:#a5a099;border:1px solid #eae7e2;border-radius:8px;font:600 13.5px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif">Send to rework</button>
<button style="padding:11px 18px;background:#f7f6f4;color:#a5a099;border:1px solid #eae7e2;border-radius:8px;font:500 13.5px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif">Accept as met, move to the delivery gate</button>
<span style="font-size:12.5px;color:#b4261a">AC6 has no answer yet — both are unarmed until every disputed criterion has one.</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<sc-if value="{{ showNotes }}" hint-placeholder-val="{{ true }}">
<div style="flex:none;width:320px;position:sticky;top:16px;font:13px/1.55 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#3f3d39">
<div style="border-left:2px solid #cfcbc4;padding:2px 0 2px 16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px">
<div><div style="font:600 10px/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#8a8680;margin-bottom:6px">BRIEF 4 · DISAGREEMENT</div><p style="margin:0;text-wrap:pretty">This is the only screen in the product that <b>breaks its own reading order</b>. Everywhere else the evidence comes first; here the disputed criteria are lifted to the top, above the criteria table, because they are the reason you were called and everything else is context for them.</p></div>
<div><p style="margin:0;text-wrap:pretty">The banner is the only <b>filled red surface</b> in the whole system — reserved for exactly one thing so it can never be mistaken for a validation error. It states the halt, then the reason for the halt in the product's own voice.</p></div>
<div><p style="margin:0;text-wrap:pretty"><b>Two columns, equal width, no verdict aggregated.</b> Ahoy must not imply a winner: no "1 of 2 reviewers", no majority language, no ordering that puts one lens first. The split is presented as a split.</p></div>
<div><p style="margin:0;text-wrap:pretty">Each reviewer shows <b>its reasoning and its file references</b>, because in nearly every real split the two are looking at different code — here, the dialog path versus the scheduled path. Seeing both file lists usually resolves it in seconds.</p></div>
<div><span style="display:inline-block;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#fbf1dd;color:#8a5a00;font:600 10px/1.6 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.06em">BEHAVIOUR CHANGE</span><p style="margin:6px 0 0;text-wrap:pretty"><b>Per-criterion "which reading holds" buttons.</b> They decide nothing — each one appends a line to the reason textarea, which stays fully editable. The browser is still just composing a string for the script. What they buy is the second half: <b>both submit buttons stay unarmed until every disputed criterion has an answer</b>, so a two-criterion split cannot be settled with a one-criterion sentence. If the harness cannot accept structured input here, this degrades to plain drafting and the arming rule falls away.</p></div>
<div><p style="margin:0;text-wrap:pretty">The agreed criteria collapse into one line. They are not hidden — they are just not why you are here.</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</sc-if>
</div>

<div id="a9" style="padding:24px 48px 12px;display:flex;gap:34px;align-items:flex-start;scroll-margin-top:16px">
<div style="flex:none;width:1180px">
<div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin:0 0 12px;font:600 11px/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#8a8680"><span style="padding:3px 7px;background:#1c1b19;color:#fff;border-radius:4px">09</span><span style="font-size:13px;letter-spacing:0;color:#1c1b19">Delivery gate, and the two states on the other side of it</span></div>
<div style="background:#faf9f7;border:1px solid #e8e5e0;border-radius:12px;padding:20px;font:14px/1.5 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1c1b19;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px">

<div>
<div style="font:11px/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;color:#8a8680;margin-bottom:8px">the gate</div>
<div style="background:#fff;border:2px solid #2563eb;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;max-width:860px">
<div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:8px">
<div style="font:600 15px/1.3 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif">◆ Accept delivery</div>
<span style="font:11.5px/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;color:#8a8680">waiting since 16:31 · no timeout</span>
</div>
<div style="display:flex;gap:20px;margin-bottom:12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#faf9f7;border-radius:8px;font-size:12.5px;color:#3f3d39">
<span><b style="color:#157f4a">7 of 7</b> criteria met, both reviewers</span>
<span><b>2</b> rework rounds</span>
<span><b>PR #4131</b> · 14 files · approved</span>
<span><b>11.8</b> AIU across 6 phases</span>
</div>
<textarea placeholder="A reason. Leave this empty to accept; write in it to send the work back or reject it." style="width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;height:70px;padding:11px 13px;border:1px solid #e8e5e0;border-radius:8px;font:13.5px/1.5 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1c1b19;resize:vertical;background:#faf9f7"></textarea>
<div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:12px;flex-wrap:wrap">
<button style="padding:11px 20px;background:#157f4a;color:#fff;border:0;border-radius:8px;font:600 13.5px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;cursor:pointer">Accept delivery</button>
<button style="padding:11px 18px;background:#f7f6f4;color:#a5a099;border:1px solid #eae7e2;border-radius:8px;font:500 13.5px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif">Send back</button>
<button style="padding:11px 18px;background:#f7f6f4;color:#a5a099;border:1px solid #eae7e2;border-radius:8px;font:500 13.5px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif">Reject</button>
<span style="font-size:12.5px;color:#6b6862">Accepting records the acceptance and marks the story done. Revisions used: 1 of 4.</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<div style="display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:flex-start">
<div style="flex:1;min-width:0">
<div style="font:11px/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;color:#8a8680;margin-bottom:8px">after accepting — done</div>
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8e5e0;border-radius:10px;padding:16px 18px">
<div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px"><span style="padding:3px 10px;border-radius:20px;background:#e8f4ec;color:#157f4a;font:600 11.5px/1.4 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif">done</span><span style="font-size:13px;color:#3f3d39">Delivered by you at 16:44, 31 Aug.</span></div>
<p style="margin:0 0 14px;font-size:13px;color:#3f3d39;max-width:64ch;text-wrap:pretty">The story is closed and nothing is running. It stays here, readable, with its whole decision log.</p>
<button style="padding:9px 15px;background:#fff;color:#8a5a00;border:1px solid #e8c98a;border-radius:8px;font:500 13px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;cursor:pointer">Reopen for rework</button>
</div>
</div>
<div style="flex:1;min-width:0">
<div style="font:11px/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;color:#8a8680;margin-bottom:8px">reopening — the consequence, before the click</div>
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8c98a;border-radius:10px;padding:16px 18px;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px #fbf1dd">
<div style="font:600 13.5px/1.35 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#8a5a00;margin-bottom:8px">Reopening clears the acceptance you recorded at 16:44.</div>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#3f3d39;max-width:60ch;text-wrap:pretty">The story leaves <span style="font:12px/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace">done</span>, returns to <span style="font:12px/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace">rework</span>, and will come back to this gate for a fresh decision. The PR is not reverted and Jira is not touched.</p>
<textarea placeholder="What needs reworking. Required." style="width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;height:58px;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #e8c98a;border-radius:8px;font:13px/1.45 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;resize:none;background:#fff"></textarea>
<div style="display:flex;gap:9px;margin-top:10px"><button style="padding:9px 15px;background:#f7f6f4;color:#a5a099;border:1px solid #eae7e2;border-radius:8px;font:600 13px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif">Clear the acceptance and rework</button><button style="padding:9px 14px;background:#fff;color:#3f3d39;border:1px solid #e8e5e0;border-radius:8px;font:500 13px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;cursor:pointer">Cancel</button></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<sc-if value="{{ showNotes }}" hint-placeholder-val="{{ true }}">
<div style="flex:none;width:320px;position:sticky;top:16px;font:13px/1.55 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#3f3d39">
<div style="border-left:2px solid #cfcbc4;padding:2px 0 2px 16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px">
<div><div style="font:600 10px/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#8a8680;margin-bottom:6px">THE SECOND GATE IS THE FIRST GATE</div><p style="margin:0;text-wrap:pretty">Same panel, same arming rule, same three verbs, same 2px border. Two gates that behave identically are two gates you only have to learn once — the only differences are the verb's noun and the summary strip.</p></div>
<div><p style="margin:0;text-wrap:pretty">The <b>summary strip</b> is the whole story in four numbers, because by the delivery gate the page above it is very long and you have often read it yesterday. It is a recap, not a substitute — the criteria still sit above.</p></div>
<div><p style="margin:0;text-wrap:pretty"><b>Only one of the three post-gate panels ever renders</b> — accept, reopen, or continue. Two would raise the question of which applies, and the harness already knows.</p></div>
<div><p style="margin:0;text-wrap:pretty">Reopen is a <b>two-step control</b>, and the second step leads with what it destroys. It is the only place a recorded acceptance can be undone, so it earns the extra click that Send back does not.</p></div>
<div><p style="margin:0;text-wrap:pretty">"The PR is not reverted and Jira is not touched" pre-empts the question that would otherwise send someone to the terminal to check.</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</sc-if>
</div>

<div id="a10" style="padding:24px 48px 12px;display:flex;gap:34px;align-items:flex-start;scroll-margin-top:16px">
<div style="flex:none;width:1180px">
<div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin:0 0 12px;font:600 11px/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#8a8680"><span style="padding:3px 7px;background:#1c1b19;color:#fff;border-radius:4px">10</span><span style="font-size:13px;letter-spacing:0;color:#1c1b19">Stalled, blocked, and the harness refusing</span></div>
<div style="background:#faf9f7;border:1px solid #e8e5e0;border-radius:12px;padding:20px;font:14px/1.5 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1c1b19;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px">

<div>
<div style="font:11px/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;color:#8a8680;margin-bottom:8px">stalled — mid-phase, nothing running</div>
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8c98a;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;max-width:900px">
<div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;padding:15px 18px;background:#fdfaf2;border-bottom:1px solid #e8c98a">
<span style="width:9px;height:9px;background:#c98a00;flex:none;margin-top:5px"></span>
<div style="flex:1">
<div style="font:600 14px/1.35 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#8a5a00">This story stopped moving three and a half hours ago.</div>
<p style="margin:4px 0 0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#3f3d39;max-width:80ch;text-wrap:pretty">It is part-way through <span style="font:12px/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace">implementation</span> with no process alive — the last thing written to <span style="font:12px/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace">state.json</span> was at 11:02 and the router's pid is gone. Nothing is wrong with the work; a terminal was closed. Continuing picks it up from where it stopped.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div style="padding:14px 18px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap">
<button style="padding:10px 18px;background:#2563eb;color:#fff;border:0;border-radius:8px;font:600 13.5px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;cursor:pointer">Continue from implementation</button>
<span style="font-size:12.5px;color:#6b6862">Runs <span style="font:12px/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace">bin/run.sh R3DA-13990</span>. WP1 is finished and stays finished; WP2 restarts.</span>
</div>
<pre style="margin:0;padding:13px 18px;background:#1c1b19;color:#8f8a82;font:11.5px/1.7 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;white-space:pre-wrap;max-height:104px;overflow:auto">  WP1 complete · 4 of 4 test ids green
  starting WP2 · description column plumbing
<span style="color:#a5a099">— last output, 11:02:41 —</span></pre>
</div>
</div>

<div style="display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:flex-start">
<div style="flex:1;min-width:0">
<div style="font:11px/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;color:#8a8680;margin-bottom:8px">blocked</div>
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #f2cdc8;border-radius:10px;padding:16px 18px">
<div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px"><span style="padding:3px 10px;border-radius:20px;background:#fbe9e7;color:#b4261a;font:600 11.5px/1.4 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif">blocked</span><span style="font:11.5px/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;color:#8a8680">since 09:12 · intake</span></div>
<div style="font:600 13.5px/1.4 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;margin-bottom:6px">The harness cannot go on without something only a person can do.</div>
<p style="margin:0 0 10px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#3f3d39;text-wrap:pretty">Intake could not reach Jira: the API token has expired. Ahoy will not retry on its own — nothing here is safe to guess at.</p>
<div style="font:11.5px/1.7 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;color:#6b6862;background:#faf9f7;border-radius:6px;padding:9px 11px;margin-bottom:12px">bin/intake.sh → exit 77<br />jira: 401 unauthorized</div>
<div style="display:flex;gap:9px"><button style="padding:9px 15px;background:#fff;color:#3f3d39;border:1px solid #e8e5e0;border-radius:8px;font:500 13px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;cursor:pointer">Try intake again</button><button style="padding:9px 15px;background:#fff;color:#b4261a;border:1px solid #f2cdc8;border-radius:8px;font:500 13px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;cursor:pointer">Abandon the story</button></div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="flex:1;min-width:0">
<div style="font:11px/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;color:#8a8680;margin-bottom:8px">state.json will not parse — the page cannot trust itself</div>
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #b4261a;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden">
<div style="padding:15px 18px 13px">
<div style="font:600 13.5px/1.4 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#b4261a;margin-bottom:6px">Ahoy cannot read this story's state.</div>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#3f3d39;text-wrap:pretty">Everything below would be a guess, so nothing is shown and no buttons are offered. The story may well be running — this page just cannot tell you about it.</p>
</div>
<pre style="margin:0;padding:12px 18px;background:#1c1b19;color:#e6b7b0;font:11.5px/1.7 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;white-space:pre-wrap;max-height:120px;overflow:auto">specs/R3DA-13712/state.json
SyntaxError: Unexpected end of JSON input
  at position 4181 (file is 4181 bytes)
  last write: 11:58:03 today</pre>
<div style="display:flex;gap:9px;padding:12px 18px;background:#fff;border-top:1px solid #f0eeea"><button style="padding:8px 13px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8e5e0;border-radius:7px;font:500 12.5px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#3f3d39;cursor:pointer">Copy the path</button><button style="padding:8px 13px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8e5e0;border-radius:7px;font:500 12.5px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#3f3d39;cursor:pointer">Re-read</button></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<sc-if value="{{ showNotes }}" hint-placeholder-val="{{ true }}">
<div style="flex:none;width:320px;position:sticky;top:16px;font:13px/1.55 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#3f3d39">
<div style="border-left:2px solid #cfcbc4;padding:2px 0 2px 16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px">
<div><div style="font:600 10px/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#8a8680;margin-bottom:6px">BRIEF 6 · FAILING HONESTLY</div><p style="margin:0;text-wrap:pretty">One block shape everywhere something went wrong: <b>a sentence in plain English, then the command and its exit code, then stderr verbatim on the dark surface.</b> Same order in the new-story panel, in blocked, and here. Learn it once.</p></div>
<div><p style="margin:0;text-wrap:pretty">Stderr is never paraphrased, truncated silently, or turned into an icon. If the sentence above it is wrong, the raw text is still there to be believed instead.</p></div>
<div><p style="margin:0;text-wrap:pretty"><b>Stalled reads as recoverable, not as failure</b> — amber, and the copy says outright that nothing is wrong with the work. Continue names what it will and will not redo, so the click is cheap to make.</p></div>
<div><p style="margin:0;text-wrap:pretty"><b>Blocked is red and offers no Continue</b>, because retrying will fail the same way until a person does something outside Ahoy. The two verbs it does offer both cost something, so neither is styled as the obvious one.</p></div>
<div><span style="display:inline-block;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#fbf1dd;color:#8a5a00;font:600 10px/1.6 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.06em">BEHAVIOUR CHANGE</span><p style="margin:6px 0 0;text-wrap:pretty">When <span style="font:11.5px/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace">state.json</span> will not parse, the detail page renders <b>nothing but the error</b> — no partial phases, no last-known values, and above all <b>no buttons</b>. A UI that offers Approve over stale state is the exact bug class the constraints call out. The page is allowed to say it does not know.</p></div>
<div><p style="margin:0;text-wrap:pretty">Copy the path, not copy the error: the fix happens in a terminal, and the path is what gets pasted there.</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</sc-if>
</div>

<div id="a11" style="padding:24px 48px 12px;display:flex;gap:34px;align-items:flex-start;scroll-margin-top:16px">
<div style="flex:none;width:1180px">
<div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin:0 0 12px;font:600 11px/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#8a8680"><span style="padding:3px 7px;background:#1c1b19;color:#fff;border-radius:4px">11</span><span style="font-size:13px;letter-spacing:0;color:#1c1b19">Components and tokens</span></div>
<div style="background:#faf9f7;border:1px solid #e8e5e0;border-radius:12px;padding:22px;font:14px/1.5 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1c1b19;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:22px">

<div>
<div style="font:600 11px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#8a8680;margin-bottom:12px">TOKENS — three added, none removed</div>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px">
<div style="width:158px;border:1px solid #e8e5e0;border-radius:9px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff"><div style="height:44px;background:#faf9f7;border-bottom:1px solid #e8e5e0"></div><div style="padding:8px 10px;font:11px/1.6 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace"><div style="color:#1c1b19">--bg</div><div style="color:#8a8680">#faf9f7</div></div></div>
<div style="width:158px;border:1px solid #e8e5e0;border-radius:9px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff"><div style="height:44px;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #e8e5e0"></div><div style="padding:8px 10px;font:11px/1.6 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace"><div style="color:#1c1b19">--surface</div><div style="color:#8a8680">#ffffff</div></div></div>
<div style="width:158px;border:1px solid #e8e5e0;border-radius:9px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff"><div style="height:44px;background:#e8e5e0;border-bottom:1px solid #e8e5e0"></div><div style="padding:8px 10px;font:11px/1.6 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace"><div style="color:#1c1b19">--line</div><div style="color:#8a8680">#e8e5e0</div></div></div>
<div style="width:158px;border:1px solid #e8e5e0;border-radius:9px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff"><div style="height:44px;background:#1c1b19;border-bottom:1px solid #e8e5e0"></div><div style="padding:8px 10px;font:11px/1.6 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace"><div style="color:#1c1b19">--text</div><div style="color:#8a8680">#1c1b19</div></div></div>
<div style="width:158px;border:1px solid #e8e5e0;border-radius:9px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff"><div style="height:44px;background:#2563eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e8e5e0"></div><div style="padding:8px 10px;font:11px/1.6 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace"><div style="color:#1c1b19">--accent</div><div style="color:#8a8680">#2563eb</div></div></div>
<div style="width:158px;border:1px solid #e8e5e0;border-radius:9px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff"><div style="height:44px;background:#157f4a;border-bottom:1px solid #e8e5e0"></div><div style="padding:8px 10px;font:11px/1.6 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace"><div style="color:#1c1b19">--ok</div><div style="color:#8a8680">#157f4a</div></div></div>
<div style="width:158px;border:1px solid #e8e5e0;border-radius:9px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff"><div style="height:44px;background:#c98a00;border-bottom:1px solid #e8e5e0"></div><div style="padding:8px 10px;font:11px/1.6 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace"><div style="color:#1c1b19">--warn</div><div style="color:#8a8680">#c98a00 · text #8a5a00</div></div></div>
<div style="width:158px;border:1px solid #e8e5e0;border-radius:9px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff"><div style="height:44px;background:#b4261a;border-bottom:1px solid #e8e5e0"></div><div style="padding:8px 10px;font:11px/1.6 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace"><div style="color:#1c1b19">--bad</div><div style="color:#8a8680">#b4261a</div></div></div>
<div style="width:158px;border:1px solid #d7e2fb;border-radius:9px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff"><div style="height:44px;background:#f4f7fe;border-bottom:1px solid #d7e2fb"></div><div style="padding:8px 10px;font:11px/1.6 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace"><div style="color:#2563eb">--accent-wash <span style="color:#c98a00">new</span></div><div style="color:#8a8680">#f4f7fe</div></div></div>
<div style="width:158px;border:1px solid #e8c98a;border-radius:9px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff"><div style="height:44px;background:#fdfaf2;border-bottom:1px solid #e8c98a"></div><div style="padding:8px 10px;font:11px/1.6 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace"><div style="color:#8a5a00">--warn-wash <span style="color:#c98a00">new</span></div><div style="color:#8a8680">#fdfaf2</div></div></div>
<div style="width:158px;border:1px solid #f2cdc8;border-radius:9px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff"><div style="height:44px;background:#fdf6f5;border-bottom:1px solid #f2cdc8"></div><div style="padding:8px 10px;font:11px/1.6 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace"><div style="color:#b4261a">--bad-wash <span style="color:#c98a00">new</span></div><div style="color:#8a8680">#fdf6f5</div></div></div>
<div style="width:158px;border:1px solid #e8e5e0;border-radius:9px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff"><div style="height:44px;background:#1c1b19;border-bottom:1px solid #e8e5e0;color:#d8d4cc;font:10px/44px ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;text-align:center">terminal</div><div style="padding:8px 10px;font:11px/1.6 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace"><div style="color:#1c1b19">--term-fg</div><div style="color:#8a8680">#d8d4cc on --text</div></div></div>
</div>
</div>

<div style="display:flex;gap:22px;flex-wrap:wrap">
<div style="flex:1;min-width:420px">
<div style="font:600 11px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#8a8680;margin-bottom:12px">PHASE AND STATE BADGES</div>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;margin-bottom:10px">
<span style="padding:4px 11px;border-radius:20px;background:#f0eeea;color:#6b6862;font:500 12px/1.4 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif">intake</span>
<span style="padding:4px 11px;border-radius:20px;background:#f0eeea;color:#6b6862;font:500 12px/1.4 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif">planning</span>
<span style="padding:4px 11px;border-radius:20px;background:#e8effc;color:#2563eb;font:600 12px/1.4 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif">◆ plan review</span>
<span style="padding:4px 11px;border-radius:20px;background:#f0eeea;color:#6b6862;font:500 12px/1.4 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif">implementation</span>
<span style="padding:4px 11px;border-radius:20px;background:#f0eeea;color:#6b6862;font:500 12px/1.4 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif">pr review</span>
<span style="padding:4px 11px;border-radius:20px;background:#f0eeea;color:#6b6862;font:500 12px/1.4 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif">rework</span>
<span style="padding:4px 11px;border-radius:20px;background:#e8effc;color:#2563eb;font:600 12px/1.4 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif">◆ delivery gate</span>
<span style="padding:4px 11px;border-radius:20px;background:#e8f4ec;color:#157f4a;font:500 12px/1.4 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif">done</span>
<span style="padding:4px 11px;border-radius:20px;background:#fbe9e7;color:#b4261a;font:600 12px/1.4 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif">blocked</span>
</div>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;margin-bottom:8px">
<span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:4px 11px;border-radius:20px;background:#e8f4ec;color:#157f4a;font:500 12px/1.4 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif"><span style="width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#157f4a"></span>running</span>
<span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:4px 11px;border-radius:20px;background:#fbf1dd;color:#8a5a00;font:500 12px/1.4 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif"><span style="width:6px;height:6px;background:#8a5a00"></span>stopped moving</span>
<span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:4px 11px;border-radius:20px;background:#e8effc;color:#2563eb;font:600 12px/1.4 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif">◆ waiting on you</span>
</div>
<div style="font-size:12.5px;color:#6b6862;max-width:56ch;text-wrap:pretty">Round dot = a process is alive. Square = it is not. Diamond = only a human moves this. Shape carries the meaning; colour repeats it.</div>
</div>

<div style="flex:1;min-width:420px">
<div style="font:600 11px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#8a8680;margin-bottom:12px">BUTTONS — four weights, and the disabled form of each</div>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:9px;margin-bottom:10px">
<button style="padding:10px 18px;background:#157f4a;color:#fff;border:0;border-radius:8px;font:600 13.5px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;cursor:pointer">Approve</button>
<button style="padding:10px 18px;background:#8a5a00;color:#fff;border:0;border-radius:8px;font:600 13.5px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;cursor:pointer">Send back</button>
<button style="padding:10px 18px;background:#fff;color:#b4261a;border:1px solid #f2cdc8;border-radius:8px;font:500 13.5px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;cursor:pointer">Reject</button>
<button style="padding:10px 18px;background:#2563eb;color:#fff;border:0;border-radius:8px;font:600 13.5px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;cursor:pointer">Continue</button>
<button style="padding:10px 16px;background:#fff;color:#3f3d39;border:1px solid #e8e5e0;border-radius:8px;font:500 13.5px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;cursor:pointer">Neutral</button>
</div>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:9px;margin-bottom:8px">
<button style="padding:10px 18px;background:#f7f6f4;color:#a5a099;border:1px solid #eae7e2;border-radius:8px;font:600 13.5px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif">Approve</button>
<button style="padding:10px 18px;background:#f7f6f4;color:#a5a099;border:1px solid #eae7e2;border-radius:8px;font:600 13.5px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif">Send back</button>
<button style="padding:10px 18px;background:#f7f6f4;color:#a5a099;border:1px solid #eae7e2;border-radius:8px;font:500 13.5px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif">Reject</button>
</div>
<div style="font-size:12.5px;color:#6b6862;max-width:56ch;text-wrap:pretty">Disabled keeps its full size and label. It is never hidden and never dimmed to the point of disappearing — an unarmed button is the product explaining its rule.</div>
</div>
</div>

<div style="display:flex;gap:22px;flex-wrap:wrap">
<div style="flex:1;min-width:340px">
<div style="font:600 11px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#8a8680;margin-bottom:12px">CALLOUTS — four, and only four</div>
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px">
<div style="border:1px solid #d7e2fb;background:#f4f7fe;border-radius:9px;padding:11px 14px;font-size:13px;color:#3f3d39"><b style="color:#1c1b19">Something wants your decision.</b> Accent wash, calm.</div>
<div style="border:1px solid #e8c98a;background:#fdfaf2;border-radius:9px;padding:11px 14px;font-size:13px;color:#3f3d39"><b style="color:#8a5a00">Something is uncertain or costs something.</b> Silence, consequences, ceilings.</div>
<div style="border:1px solid #f2cdc8;background:#fdf6f5;border-radius:9px;padding:11px 14px;font-size:13px;color:#3f3d39"><b style="color:#b4261a">Something failed or is disputed.</b> Bordered, not filled.</div>
<div style="background:#b4261a;border-radius:9px;padding:11px 14px;font-size:13px;color:#fff"><b>The halt.</b> Filled red, used in exactly one place: reviewers split.</div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="flex:1;min-width:340px">
<div style="font:600 11px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#8a8680;margin-bottom:12px">SCRIPT RESULT — the one failure shape</div>
<div style="border:1px solid #f2cdc8;border-radius:9px;overflow:hidden">
<div style="background:#fdf6f5;padding:10px 13px;border-bottom:1px solid #f2cdc8"><div style="font:600 12.5px/1.35 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#b4261a">What it means, in a sentence.</div><div style="font:11px/1.6 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;color:#8a5a00">bin/&lt;script&gt;.sh &lt;args&gt; → exit N</div></div>
<pre style="margin:0;padding:10px 13px;background:#1c1b19;color:#e6e2db;font:11px/1.6 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;white-space:pre-wrap">stderr, verbatim, scrollable, never paraphrased</pre>
<div style="display:flex;gap:8px;padding:9px 13px;background:#fff"><button style="padding:5px 9px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8e5e0;border-radius:6px;font:11.5px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#3f3d39;cursor:pointer">Copy output</button><button style="padding:5px 9px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8e5e0;border-radius:6px;font:11.5px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#3f3d39;cursor:pointer">Try again</button></div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="flex:1;min-width:300px">
<div style="font:600 11px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#8a8680;margin-bottom:12px">MARKDOWN / SOURCE TOGGLE · VERDICTS · CEILING</div>
<div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px"><div style="display:flex;border:1px solid #e8e5e0;border-radius:7px;overflow:hidden;font:500 11.5px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif"><span style="padding:6px 11px;background:#1c1b19;color:#fff">Reading</span><span style="padding:6px 11px;background:#fff;color:#6b6862">Source</span></div><span style="font-size:12px;color:#8a8680">state survives the 3s redraw</span></div>
<div style="display:flex;gap:7px;margin-bottom:12px"><span style="padding:3px 9px;border-radius:20px;background:#e8f4ec;color:#157f4a;font:600 11.5px/1.4 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif">met</span><span style="padding:3px 9px;border-radius:20px;background:#fbe9e7;color:#b4261a;font:600 11.5px/1.4 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif">not met</span><span style="padding:3px 9px;border-radius:20px;background:#f0eeea;color:#6b6862;font:600 11.5px/1.4 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif">not reviewed</span></div>
<div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:12px;color:#8a5a00"><span style="display:inline-flex;gap:3px"><span style="width:9px;height:9px;background:#c98a00;border-radius:2px"></span><span style="width:9px;height:9px;background:#c98a00;border-radius:2px"></span><span style="width:9px;height:9px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #c98a00;border-radius:2px"></span><span style="width:9px;height:9px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #c98a00;border-radius:2px"></span></span><span style="font:600 12px/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace">2 of 4 revisions used</span></div>
</div>
</div>

<div>
<div style="font:600 11px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#8a8680;margin-bottom:12px">TYPE — two faces, six sizes</div>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:26px;align-items:baseline">
<div><div style="font:600 20px/1.2 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace">R3DA-14022</div><div style="font:11px/1.6 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;color:#8a8680">mono 20 / 600 · story key</div></div>
<div><div style="font:600 16px/1.3 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif">Panel and halt headings</div><div style="font:11px/1.6 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;color:#8a8680">sans 15–16 / 600</div></div>
<div><div style="font:14px/1.5 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif">Prose and criteria — full sentences</div><div style="font:11px/1.6 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;color:#8a8680">sans 13.5–14 / 400</div></div>
<div><div style="font:12.5px/1.5 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#6b6862">Secondary, timestamps, hints</div><div style="font:11px/1.6 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;color:#8a8680">sans 12–12.5 · --text at 60%</div></div>
<div><div style="font:12px/1.5 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace">phases · paths · exit codes</div><div style="font:11px/1.6 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;color:#8a8680">mono 11–12</div></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<sc-if value="{{ showNotes }}" hint-placeholder-val="{{ true }}">
<div style="flex:none;width:320px;position:sticky;top:16px;font:13px/1.55 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#3f3d39">
<div style="border-left:2px solid #cfcbc4;padding:2px 0 2px 16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px">
<div><div style="font:600 10px/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#8a8680;margin-bottom:6px">WHAT THE SYSTEM ADDS</div><p style="margin:0;text-wrap:pretty">Three wash tokens, so a callout can be tinted without a new hue, and a terminal foreground. Everything else is what is already in the stylesheet. All of it is flat colour, borders and radius — nothing here needs a gradient, a shadow beyond one soft rail, or a single line of animation.</p></div>
<div><p style="margin:0;text-wrap:pretty"><b>Shape carries state, colour repeats it.</b> Dot / square / diamond survive a colour-blind reader and a grayscale screenshot pasted into a ticket.</p></div>
<div><p style="margin:0;text-wrap:pretty">Filled red is <b>rationed to one component</b>. The moment a second thing uses it, the split stops being unmissable.</p></div>
<div><p style="margin:0;text-wrap:pretty">Everything on this sheet is hand-writable CSS with no build step: flat fills, 1px borders, 8–10px radius, two system faces.</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</sc-if>
</div>

<div style="padding:30px 48px 70px;max-width:1000px;font:14px/1.6 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1c1b19">
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8e5e0;border-radius:12px;padding:26px 30px">
<div style="font:600 10px/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#8a8680;margin-bottom:10px">WHERE I DISAGREE WITH THE BRIEF</div>
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;max-width:82ch">
<div><b>The 3-second idle inference should not gate the input.</b> The brief calls this the weakest moment in the product, and I think the weakness is not the inference's accuracy — it is that a wrong inference takes away the keyboard. Let the guess change the words and never the capability, and the problem stops being a correctness problem.</div>
<div><b>"Stalled" should not be a phase badge with a modifier.</b> The brief lists it as a state the UI must express; I would give it its own group and its own vocabulary in the list, because the whole failure of today's sidebar is that <i>implementation</i> means two different things. Cost: one more group heading in a 250px column.</div>
<div><b>I would not add a sticky Approve, and I'd resist it if it comes up.</b> "Hard to reach" and "hard to make carelessly" are the same property here. A sticky rail that only navigates gets the reachability without the nudge.</div>
<div><b>The per-criterion buttons on the disagreement screen are the one place I have gone past restyling.</b> They compose text rather than deciding anything, so they respect the constraint — but the arming rule that comes with them (every disputed criterion needs an answer) is new behaviour and needs the harness's blessing. Without it, the screen still works; it just cannot stop a one-line answer to a two-criterion split.</div>
<div><b>Everything on artboard 10's unparseable case is a refusal to render.</b> That will feel like a regression the first time someone hits it, and it is the correct behaviour. Worth agreeing on before it ships.</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</x-dc>
<script type="text/x-dc" data-dc-script data-props="{&quot;showNotes&quot;:{&quot;editor&quot;:&quot;boolean&quot;,&quot;default&quot;:true,&quot;tsType&quot;:&quot;boolean&quot;,&quot;section&quot;:&quot;Canvas&quot;},&quot;showChangeFlags&quot;:{&quot;editor&quot;:&quot;boolean&quot;,&quot;default&quot;:true,&quot;tsType&quot;:&quot;boolean&quot;,&quot;section&quot;:&quot;Canvas&quot;}}">
class Component extends DCLogic {
  renderVals() {
    const p = this.props || {};
    return {
      showNotes: p.showNotes ?? true,
      showFlags: p.showChangeFlags ?? true
    };
  }
}
</script>
</body>
</html>
